<!--Post: 13321--><!--Time: 1115005673-->
<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#cccccc"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST13321"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Embersage<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Embersage<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->2-2005<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Sunday, May 01, 2005 - 8:47 pm: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->Very Interesting Screamer. Thank YOu. It shows Rader&#39;s attitude after the arrest. When he used humor concerning his job status. I am glad that they unsealed the documents. Sorry to see that Charlie may have to testify. I am sure he will be glad when this is over. Just like the others.  Thanks Sheila<!--/Text--></td></tr>
<!--/Post: 13321-->
<!--Post: 13373--><!--Time: 1115163364-->
<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#f7f7f7"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST13373"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Tac<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Tac<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->11-2004<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Tuesday, May 03, 2005 - 4:36 pm: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->Em <BR> <BR>I am very glad that Charlie has the chance to face his family&#39;s killer. I believe Charlie will be instructed to show no torment or emotion other than rage. I would like to see Charlie point out the following: <BR> <BR>1.Charlie will be out there ready to execute Rader if he walks away a free man. <BR> <BR>2.Rader will be raped and possibly gang raped repeatedly. <BR> <BR>3.Rader will be a major target to be tormented and then murdered like Dahmer. <BR> <BR>4.Prison officials and guards may even secretly facilitate Rader&#39;s assasination; they will definitely ignore and cover up any threats against Rader. <BR> <BR>5.Rader will spend the rest of his short miserable life with absoultely NO CONTROL OVER HIS OWN LIFE.  <BR> <BR>He will be told when to eat, when to sleep, when to wake, where to exercise, what to wear, and how to act.  .  .  total state control !!!!!! <BR> <BR><!--/Text--></td></tr>
<!--/Post: 13373-->
<!--Post: 13378--><!--Time: 1115167102-->
<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#cccccc"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST13378"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Johno<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Johno<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->12-2004<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Tuesday, May 03, 2005 - 5:38 pm: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->Tac, do you really want Charlie Otero to become an assassin and thus end of up serving life in prison or face the death penalty if it&#39;s reinstated in Kansas? <BR>To suggest that prison officials and guards may secretly facilitate Rader&#39;s assasination and definately ignore and cover up any threats against him is an insult to the Kansas prison administration and correctional officers. <BR>Jeffery Dahmer wasn&#39;t killed by someone who had targeted him for his crimes. He was killed by a convicted double murderer, delusional schitzophrenic Christopher Scarver who also killed the other man of their three man work detail Jesse Anderson. He claimed he was the son of God and God had instructed him to kill these two men with a lead pipe. Scarver wasn&#39;t trying to be a Jack Ruby. He was as nutty as Dahmer.<!--/Text--></td></tr>
<!--/Post: 13378-->
<!--Post: 13404--><!--Time: 1115219281-->
<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#f7f7f7"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST13404"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Elsewhere<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Elsewhere<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->10-2004<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Wednesday, May 04, 2005 - 8:08 am: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->Johno - you have such great values and perspectives...but please understand alot of this is just venting in addition to there are some very personal issues here.  We all wish nothing but the best for Charlie...but Charlie I know somehow will have his day...somehow...<!--/Text--></td></tr>
<!--/Post: 13404-->
